<title>USA: American Homestar sets 5-for-4 stock split.</title>
<headline>American Homestar sets 5-for-4 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Homestar Corp said Friday it had declared a five-for-four stock split, payable February 7, record January 24.</p>
<p>After the split, there will be 10.8 million shares outstanding, compared to 8.6 million at present.</p>
</text>
